        "html_9PyUAj": {
          "type": "html",
          "settings": {
            "custom_html": "<div class=\"misjoyas-accordion\">\n\n<!-- DESPACHO -->\n<div class=\"misjoyas-item\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n<span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__label\">\n  <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__icon misjoyas-accordion-btn__icon--shipping\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <img src=\"{{ 'envios.svg' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__text\">\n    <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__title\">Despacho a domicilio gratis</span>\n    <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__subtitle\">Por compras sobre $99.990 · a todo Chile</span>\n  </span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"misjoyas-arrow\">+</span>\n</button>\n\n<div class=\"misjoyas-content\">\n<p>En MISJOYAS® trabajamos para que recibas tu pedido de forma rápida y segura.</p>\n<p>Tu pedido se procesará en un plazo máximo de <strong>24 horas hábiles</strong> una vez confirmado el pago.</p>\n<p>Realizamos envíos a todo Chile mediante:</p>\n<p>• Chilexpress<br>• Correos de Chile</p>\n<p><strong>✓ Despacho Gratis</strong><br>\nPor compras sobre <strong>$99.990</strong> obtienes <strong>DESPACHO GRATIS</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- BENEFICIOS -->\n<div class=\"misjoyas-item\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n<span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__label\">\n  <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <img src=\"{{ 'beneficios2.svg' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__text\">\n    <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__title\">Beneficios y descuentos</span>\n    <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__subtitle\">Descuentos exclusivos mayoristas y tarjeta de fidelización.</span>\n  </span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"misjoyas-arrow\">+</span>\n</button>\n\n<div class=\"misjoyas-content\">\n<p>En MISJOYAS® buscamos que cada compra cumpla con tus expectativas.</p>\n<p><strong>✓ Garantía legal</strong><br>\nSi recibes un producto con fallas de fábrica puedes pedir reparación, cambio o devolución hasta <strong>6 meses</strong> después de recibirlo.</p>\n<p><strong>✓ Garantía de satisfacción MISJOYAS®</strong><br>\nSi el producto no cumple tus expectativas puedes solicitar cambio o devolución dentro de los <strong>primeros 10 días</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>✓ Cómo realizar tu cambio o devolución</strong></p>\n<p>Correo: contacto@misjoyas.cl<br>WhatsApp: +56 9 4545 4917</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- CAMBIOS -->\n<div class=\"misjoyas-item\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n<span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__label\">\n  <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <img src=\"{{ 'cambios.svg' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__text\">\n    <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__title\">Cambios y devoluciones</span>\n    <span class=\"misjoyas-accordion-btn__subtitle\">En MISJOYAS® buscamos que cada compra cumpla con tus expectativas.</span>\n  </span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"misjoyas-arrow\">+</span>\n</button>\n\n<div class=\"misjoyas-content\">\n<p><strong>✓ Tarjeta de fidelización</strong></p>\n<p>En tu primera compra desde <strong>$80.000</strong> recibes tu tarjeta de fidelización y un sticker para acumular beneficios.</p>\n<p>Cada compra posterior sobre este monto recibe un sticker. Al completar <strong>10 stickers</strong> recibes un <strong>regalo premium exclusivo</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Importante:</strong> debes iniciar sesión antes de comprar para recibir este beneficio.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.misjoyas-accordion{\n  display:flex;\n  flex-direction:column;\n  gap:12px;\n  width:100%;\n  margin:0;\n  font-family:inherit;\n}\n.misjoyas-item{\n  border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\n  border-radius:4px;\n  overflow:hidden;\n  background:#fff;\n  margin:0;\n}\n.misjoyas-accordion-btn{\n  width:100%;\n  background:#fff;\n  border:none;\n  padding:16px;\n  text-align:left;\n  color:#222;\n  display:flex;\n  justify-content:space-between;\n  align-items:center;\n  gap:12px;\n  cursor:pointer;\n  font-family:inherit;\n}\n.misjoyas-accordion-btn:hover{\n  background:#fafafa;\n}\n.misjoyas-accordion-btn__label{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  gap:12px;\n  flex:1;\n  min-width:0;\n}\n.misjoyas-accordion-btn__icon{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center;\n  flex-shrink:0;\n  width:28px;\n  height:28px;\n}\n.misjoyas-accordion-btn__icon--shipping{\n  width:24px;\n  height:24px;\n}\n.misjoyas-accordion-btn__icon img{\n  display:block;\n  width:28px;\n  height:28px;\n}\n.misjoyas-accordion-btn__icon--shipping img{\n  width:24px;\n  height:24px;\n}\n.misjoyas-accordion-btn__text{\n  display:flex;\n  flex-direction:column;\n  gap:2px;\n  min-width:0;\n}\n.misjoyas-accordion-btn__title{\n  color:#222;\n  font-size:14px;\n  font-weight:700;\n  line-height:normal;\n}\n.misjoyas-accordion-btn__subtitle{\n  color:#737373;\n  font-size:14px;\n  font-weight:400;\n  line-height:normal;\n}\n.misjoyas-arrow{\n  flex-shrink:0;\n  font-size:20px;\n  font-weight:400;\n  line-height:1;\n  color:#000;\n  width:1em;\n  text-align:center;\n}\n.misjoyas-content{\n  max-height:0;\n  overflow:hidden;\n  transition:max-height .35s ease;\n  padding:0 16px;\n  font-size:13px;\n  color:#555;\n}\n.misjoyas-content.is-open{\n  padding-bottom:16px;\n}\n.misjoyas-content p{\n  margin:10px 0;\n  line-height:1.6;\n}\n.misjoyas-content p:first-child{\n  margin-top:0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".misjoyas-accordion\").forEach(function (accordion) {\n    if (accordion.dataset.bound) return;\n    accordion.dataset.bound = \"1\";\n\n    accordion.querySelectorAll(\".misjoyas-accordion-btn\").forEach(function (btn) {\n      btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n        var item = btn.closest(\".misjoyas-item\");\n        var content = item.querySelector(\".misjoyas-content\");\n        var arrow = btn.querySelector(\".misjoyas-arrow\");\n        var isOpen = btn.getAttribute(\"aria-expanded\") === \"true\";\n\n        accordion.querySelectorAll(\".misjoyas-accordion-btn\").forEach(function (otherBtn) {\n          otherBtn.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", \"false\");\n          otherBtn.querySelector(\".misjoyas-arrow\").textContent = \"+\";\n        });\n        accordion.querySelectorAll(\".misjoyas-content\").forEach(function (c) {\n          c.style.maxHeight = null;\n          c.classList.remove(\"is-open\");\n        });\n\n        if (!isOpen) {\n          btn.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", \"true\");\n          content.classList.add(\"is-open\");\n          content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + \"px\";\n          arrow.textContent = \"−\";\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>"
          }
        },
        "html_fMA38V": {
          "type": "html",
          "settings": {
            "custom_html": "{%- liquid\n  assign wa_phone = '56945454917'\n  assign wa_message = '¡Hola! 👋 Me interesa esta pieza: ' | append: product.title | append: '. ¿Me pueden contar un poco más, por favor?'\n  assign wa_text = wa_message | url_encode\n  assign wa_url = 'https://wa.me/' | append: wa_phone | append: '?text=' | append: wa_text\n-%}\n<a\n  class=\"misjoyas-wa-help\"\n  href=\"{{ wa_url }}\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n  aria-label=\"Escríbenos por WhatsApp\"\n>\n  <span class=\"misjoyas-wa-help__left\">\n    <span class=\"misjoyas-wa-help__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <img\n        src=\"{{ 'misjoyas-icon-whatsapp.svg' | asset_url }}\"\n        alt=\"\"\n        width=\"24\"\n        height=\"24\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      >\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"misjoyas-wa-help__question\">¿Tienes dudas con esta pieza?</span>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"misjoyas-wa-help__cta\">Escríbenos por WhatsApp</span>\n</a>\n\n<style>\n.misjoyas-wa-help{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:space-between;\n  gap:12px;\n  width:100%;\n  margin-top:20px;\n  margin-bottom:20px;\n  padding:10px 16px;\n  background:rgba(121,213,201,0.24);\n  border-radius:4px;\n  color:#000;\n  text-decoration:none;\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n  font-family:inherit;\n}\n.misjoyas-wa-help:hover{\n  color:#000;\n  text-decoration:none;\n}\n.misjoyas-wa-help__left{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  gap:8px;\n  min-width:0;\n}\n.misjoyas-wa-help__icon{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center;\n  flex-shrink:0;\n  width:24px;\n  height:24px;\n}\n.misjoyas-wa-help__icon img{\n  display:block;\n  width:24px;\n  height:24px;\n}\n.misjoyas-wa-help__question{\n  font-size:14px;\n  font-weight:700;\n  line-height:normal;\n}\n.misjoyas-wa-help__cta{\n  flex-shrink:0;\n  font-size:14px;\n  font-weight:400;\n  line-height:normal;\n  text-decoration:underline;\n  text-underline-offset:2px;\n}\n@media (max-width:600px){\n  .misjoyas-wa-help{\n    flex-wrap:wrap;\n    gap:8px;\n  }\n  .misjoyas-wa-help__cta{\n    margin-left:32px;\n  }\n}\n</style>"
          }
        },
        "html_cgMNhC": {
          "type": "html",
          "settings": {
            "custom_html": "<div class=\"misjoyas-payment\">\n  <span class=\"misjoyas-payment__label\">Paga seguro:</span>\n  <div class=\"misjoyas-payment__logos\">\n    <img\n      class=\"misjoyas-payment__logo misjoyas-payment__logo--webpay\"\n      src=\"{{ 'webpay.png' | asset_url }}\"\n      alt=\"Webpay Plus Transbank\"\n      width=\"228\"\n      height=\"40\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n    >\n    <img\n      class=\"misjoyas-payment__logo misjoyas-payment__logo--mp\"\n      src=\"{{ 'mercado-pago.png' | asset_url }}\"\n      alt=\"Mercado Pago\"\n      width=\"100\"\n      height=\"40\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n    >\n    <img\n      class=\"misjoyas-payment__logo misjoyas-payment__logo--transfer\"\n      src=\"{{ 'transferencia.png' | asset_url }}\"\n      alt=\"Transferencia bancaria\"\n      width=\"100\"\n      height=\"40\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n    >\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.misjoyas-payment{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  gap:12px;\n  width:100%;\n  margin-top:20px;\n  margin-bottom:20px;\n  font-family:inherit;\n}\n.misjoyas-payment__label{\n  flex-shrink:0;\n  color:#000;\n  font-size:14px;\n  font-weight:700;\n  line-height:normal;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.misjoyas-payment__logos{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  flex-wrap:wrap;\n  gap:12px;\n  min-width:0;\n}\n.misjoyas-payment__logo{\n  display:block;\n  height:40px;\n  width:auto;\n  object-fit:contain;\n}\n.misjoyas-payment__logo--webpay{\n  width:228px;\n  max-width:100%;\n}\n.misjoyas-payment__logo--mp,\n.misjoyas-payment__logo--transfer{\n  width:100px;\n}\n@media (max-width:600px){\n  .misjoyas-payment{\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    flex-direction:column;\n    gap:10px;\n  }\n  .misjoyas-payment__logo--webpay{\n    width:180px;\n  }\n  .misjoyas-payment__logo--mp,\n  .misjoyas-payment__logo--transfer{\n    width:90px;\n  }\n}\n</style>"
